@sprint3 @issue-16 @pdf @download
Feature: [Issue #16] Fitur Pratinjau dan Unduh Berkas Surat Pengantar PDF Resmi
  As a registered resident or RT administrator
  I want to preview and download official signed letter PDF documents
  So that administrative letters can be verified, printed, and used for formal requirements

  Background:
    Given the RTConnect backend application is ready
    And the resident "resident@example.test" and the RT head "rt@example.test" are logged in with password "LocalTestOnly#2026"

  Scenario: Warga berhasil mengunduh berkas PDF surat resmi yang telah disahkan
    Given an approved and digitally signed "DOM" letter application exists for the resident
    When the resident requests to download the official letter PDF
    Then the response status code should be 200
    And the response content type should be "application/pdf"
    And the downloaded file should be a valid PDF
    And the response binary length should be at least 1000 bytes
    And the response header "Content-Disposition" should contain "attachment"
    And the response header "Content-Disposition" should contain ".pdf"

  Scenario: Warga mengakses pratinjau dokumen PDF resmi secara in-app
    Given an approved and digitally signed "KTP" letter application exists for the resident
    When the resident requests to preview the official letter PDF
    Then the response status code should be 200
    And the response content type should be "application/pdf"
    And the downloaded file should be a valid PDF

  Scenario: Pengunduhan berkas ditolak jika pengajuan surat belum disahkan
    Given an unapproved letter application with status "diajukan" exists for the resident
    When the resident requests to download the official letter PDF
    Then the response status code should be 404
    And the response JSON should indicate failure
    And the response field "error" should be "NOT_FOUND"

  Scenario: Warga dilarang mengunduh dokumen surat milik warga lain
    Given an approved and digitally signed letter application belongs to another resident
    When the resident attempts to download the other resident's letter PDF
    Then the response status code should be 403
    And the response JSON should indicate failure
    And the response field "error" should be "FORBIDDEN"

  Scenario: Ketua RT dapat mengunduh dan memeriksa berkas PDF resmi warga yang telah disahkan
    Given an approved and digitally signed "DOM" letter application exists for the resident
    When the RT head requests to download the official letter PDF
    Then the response status code should be 200
    And the response content type should be "application/pdf"
    And the downloaded file should be a valid PDF

  Scenario: Pengunduhan berkas dengan ID pengajuan tidak terdaftar menghasilkan 404
    When the resident requests to download a letter PDF with non-existent ID 999999
    Then the response status code should be 404
    And the response JSON should indicate failure
    And the response field "error" should be "NOT_FOUND"

  Scenario: Pengunduhan berkas ditolak tanpa token autentikasi
    Given an approved and digitally signed "DOM" letter application exists for the resident
    When an unauthenticated user requests to download the official letter PDF
    Then the response status code should be 401
    And the response JSON should indicate failure
    And the response field "error" should be "UNAUTHORIZED"
